       hexactsize 0
       vexactsize 0
       scaled 1
       style DayZNormal
       text "\"Hey! Don't think I've seen you before, or have I?! I'll turn the bus around and get you to your destination. That'll end your precious little leg field trip pretty damn quick, eh? "\
       "So many years has passed and so few Survivors to drive around in this Godforsaken land...but I can't help it. I love my Bus, the country roads and the fresh air. It's the only thing left that reminds me of the time before the event. Hell I'll even drive from here to your destination all day back and forth by myself if I get bored. You don't say much do you? That's ok, we're soon there.\" "
       font "gui/fonts/metron16"
       "exact text" 1
       "size to text h" 0
       "size to text v" 0
       "text halign" center
